+-- LINEOUT of a line to a stream: what LINEOUT returns, or the code of the
+-- syntax error it raises
+::routine lineoutRC
+  use strict arg stream, line
+  signal on syntax
+  return stream~lineout(line)
+  syntax: return condition("o")~rc
